{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/5ccc0a354454a3bd26fee043c9f4b3de.avif?t=1773779327\" width=1560 height=653 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/b8ec9aa58b96db88773b8694a5447696.avif?t=1773779327\" width=1200 height=700 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Welcome to the College of Magical Arts, an institution where you either unlock your magical potential or... end up in a 9 \u00be dorm.</i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing all of your entrance exams and being exiled from home, you have no hope left. But an unexpected letter from a mysterious college gives you one last chance at a new life. Except there's just one problem: you have no magic. None at all.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >After failing a test for magical abilities, you find yourself among the strangest students on campus. And on your first night, you're &quot;attacked&quot; by Lucy, an incubus who wants to get a taste of the fresh blood.... When you cum, Lucy's magical power overflows and he transforms from the excess power...</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It's then that you find out that you have a rare gift: you're an Amplifier, able to amplify other people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/3fb846c80efd1713c5645a435a624d03.avif?t=1773779327\" width=748 height=314 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Letter from College of Magic Arts","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/322a8ce3d894552d13b249dad5b1c5101a8d05cd.jpg"},{"name":"Sex seal","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/2f825f2873c5b9251f681d36907ea718f427c5ee.jpg"},{"name":"What's going on?!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/68b30cd3885d8650b8236b09e660fa8fc54728cb.jpg"},{"name":"Challenge accepted!","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/d15c6e4273ffc00d63ed8832a5b119b839d82266.jpg"},{"name":"Unscheduled inspection","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/64ba511fe6f018dfb63704aea59d437dd8441c2d.jpg"},{"name":"Doomsday clock on midnight","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/c85b7bffcdc7b3b39b808c64905af83011bd9564.jpg"},{"name":"The consequences of unprotected sex","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3602290/f124d8f