ther people's magic. Now you're the object of attention, which means you'll have to juggle school, work, and social interactions to avoid getting kicked out of college.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Life simulator set in a magical dormitory - make friends, make enemies, get involved in crazy adventures. Colorful characters, exciting plot, funny dialogues and hot sex scenes. All this is waiting for you in <strong>FEMBOY FUTA HOUSE!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/extras/3fb846c80efd1713c5645a435a624d03.avif?t=1773779327\" width=748 height=314 /></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Game Features:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Complete daily tasks (can something terrible happen if you don't do them?...)</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A calendar packed with events - each day brings new challenges, unexpected encounters and plot twists</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Mini-games and activities - study, pass magic tests, participate in activities</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore campus - secret rooms, quirky teachers and strange neighbors are waiting for you</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your power is someone else's magic - help (or hinder) others using your unique ability</p></li></ul>","developers":["IT'S A TRAP"],"dlc":[3963440,3963390,3963400,3963410,3963420,3963430,4131790],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"},{"description":"Casual","id":"4"},{"description":"RPG","id":"3"},{"description":"Simulation","id":"28"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3602290/6385a10d2c3f15d06559ee06a59891960483708d/header.jpg?t=1773779327","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"ma